{"id":"dormitorio","lemma":"dormitorio","pos":"noun","rank":1988,"glosses":["bedroom (a room in a house, apartment, hotel, or other dwelling where a bed is kept for sleeping)","dormitory"],"ipa":"/doɾmiˈtoɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dormitorios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-dormitorio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esa puerta da paso al dormitorio.","en":"The door opens into the bedroom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634997","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"step, footstep"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Mi casa tiene dos dormitorios.","en":"My house has two bedrooms.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590335","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null]},{"text":"Tengo mi dormitorio propio en casa.","en":"I have my own bedroom at home.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"own"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"home"]]},{"text":"Vivimos en una casa con tres dormitorios.","en":"We live in a three-bedroom house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538113","words":[{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Ella me mostró su dormitorio.","en":"She showed me her room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461403","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to show","l":"mostrar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}